      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "二人的约定，就这样迎来结局。\r\n但是她们的比赛却仍未落幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76717cb1a4d67058c798c6d94f9e4da298e800660e96b683803e87698d84d8b6",
